  "title": "Britannica School: Early Elementary Content Catalog Resources - Britannica Education - US",
  "text": "Home\nSolutions\nTraining\nResources\nSupport\nSign In\nDemo & Pricing\nSolutions\n\nDiscover solutions that spark curiosity, deepen understanding, and prepare learners for the future.\n\nBrowse all Solutions\nPreK-12\nBritannica Studio\nBritannica School\nBritannica Expedition: Learn!\nBritannica ImageQuest\nBritannica ImageQuest Jr.\nBritannica LaunchPacks\nHigher Education\nBritannica Academic\nMerriam-Webster Unabridged\nBritannica Original Sources\nMultilingual Resources\nHello Britannica\nBritannica Escolar\nLibrary Services\nBritannica Library\nBritannica Collective\nResources\n\nAccess curated resources, tools, and content to support learning, research, and skill building.\n\nBrowse all Resources\nClassroom Resources\nUpcoming Webinars ▶️\nHispanic Heritage Month 🌎\nTeach Britannica\nResponsible AI Hub\nMedia Literacy Hub\nCase Studies\nResource Library\nThe Latest from Britannica Education\nWebinars\nBlog\nNewsroom\nSupport\n\nNeed help? You've come to the right place.\n\nContact Support\nStatewide Access\nExplore Funding\nAccess and Integration\nFrequently Asked Questions\nBritannica School Onboarding\nContact Us\n\nLet us know if you need support!\n\nGet in Touch\nHome\nBritannica School: Early Elementary Content Catalog\nBritannica School: Early Elementary\nContent Catalog\n\nWith rich visuals, read-aloud features, easy-to-understand explanations, and content designed to spark curiosity, Britannica School: Early Elementary helps build foundational knowledge and encourages young learners to ask questions, make connections, and develop a lifelong love of learning.\n\nBrowse All Articles\nGet a Demo\nAll-New Interactives\n\nAs we expand our database monthly with brand-new articles—in both English and native Spanish—we’re also introducing interactives this year! Instead of just reading or listening to article information, now early learners can click and interact with content, bringing learning to life.\n\nComing soon:\n\nAbraham Lincoln\nAnimal Groups: Mammals\nFast or Slow Earth Changes\nFrog Life Cycle\nLion\nLunar New Year Traditions\nLet’s Explore!\n\nBrowse over 1,000 articles covering animals, science, nature, history, inspiring people, geography, civics, and culture—all carefully curated with age-appropriate topics and language for early elementary students.\n\nSubscribers can click each title to read the article in Britannica School!\n\nSearch articles\nCategory\nAll categories\nContent type\nAll content\nNew articles\nInteractives\nClear filters\nCatalog could not be loaded.\nCatalog loading error\n\nThe catalog endpoint returned status 429.\n\nTools for Teacher Success\n\nWhether you’re diving into the wonders of the animal kingdom, taking a trip through history, or uncovering cool science facts, these resources make supporting your students seamless and stress-free.\n\nTeach Britannica\n\nWe know supporting young patrons is an adventure, so we’ve packed our resource hub Teach Britannica with ready-to-use activities and playful prompts to keep little minds exploring.\n\nEarly Elementary Lesson Minis\nOctober 2026\nDownload\nDaily Content Calendars\n\nOur daily content calendars are like a magic toolkit—packed with fun, ready-to-go lessons that turn everyday moments into learning adventures! No more last-minute scrambling—just engaging, easy-to-use resources that make learning feel like a celebration every single day!\n\nView All Content Calendars\nWhen Curiosity Leads, Learning Follows.\n\nFrom “Why?” to “Wow!”—inspiring discovery one question at a time.\n\nPhone: (800)-621-3900\nEmail: contact@eb.com\nContact Us →\n\nAbout\n\nHome\nAbout Us\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\n© 2026 Encyclopædia Britannica, Inc\n\nFree Icons from Streamline",
